{"server":"cn","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_02_beg","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_02","title":"腿部拆卸疗法","storyCode":"EP-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ca74b3ea92532d008c83cf03600341ab1984803cd802667fa85d848d0c106ed2","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g11_meetingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人的时候，您永远都看着大海的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得小时候，您抱着我，指着远处说，继续往前，就能看到比天空还要湛蓝的海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那已经是五十年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，您至今也未曾忘记百年前的往事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，小珍珠，若你像我一样曾驾驶着船只在海浪中翻腾，看闪电在云间交会，耳边是不绝的雷声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也只能用一生去怀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好奇啊，长辈们心心念念的海洋到底是什么模样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一辈子我都生活在盐漠里，恐怕想破头也想不出个所以然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是我家那老爷子，临死前天天念叨的都是出海出海，说他跟着您和科鲁兹船长把船舱塞满财宝，钱币多得快要把船压沉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你父亲是我见过手脚最敏捷的操帆手，在桅杆上攀爬如履平地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，那些真正见识过海洋的船员没剩多少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这正是我担心的问题，夫人，就算有罗盘的引领，我们也缺乏老练的海员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小珍珠，面对海洋，我们都是鲁莽无知的孩童。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......如今我们连面对这片盐漠都开始觉得吃力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探子回来报告，雅隆来了一个厉害家伙，几乎掐断了所有商路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们终于要动真格了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人，那人准确找出了我们与商队接触的地点，之前的几十年，镇子里的那些草包可连踪迹都摸不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......重兵把守的罗盘被窃，这对审判庭来说近乎羞辱与挑衅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，他们不会轻易放过我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间不多了，那小子又油盐不进......该如何是好，夫人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许他没骗我们，他真的不是炼金术师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能肯定他的身份，小珍珠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他身上有枚金币，正反两面分别有代表“盐”与“水”的图样，是一支特殊炼金流派的标志，它们的意思是“向海而生”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识金币原来的主人，奥卢斯，他是那一派中最有才的炼金术师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且那小家伙还用着和奥卢斯一样的剑术，言谈举止也有些相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许他们只是认识，金币就是随手送的礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，如果奥卢斯将那枚金币赠予他人，只说明他对那人抱有超乎寻常的期望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按他们流派的规矩，那枚金币只能由老师传给学生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那小子为何死不承认？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得困惑，明明已经再三申明，他不必承担任何风险......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"年幼的伊西多狠狠地咬住牙根，却压不住牙床深处泛上来的酸涩。\n眼前，昔日同窗的尸体就在恩师脚下。\n早已冰冷的四肢上，还残留着令他作呕的淡蓝色黏液。\n泪水模糊了他的视线，一个流水般温柔的声音不请自来地探入他内心深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要抹去自己的眼泪，伊西多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是你杀了他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海洋与陆地本是一体，融合，不过是抹消彼此间的隔阂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他自愿作出这样的决定，拥抱自己体内流淌的盐与水，与我们共享他存在的全部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再无恐惧、憎恶、嘲笑与痛恨......再无紧闭的门窗，再无封闭的内心，再无污秽的血脉，再无可耻的伤痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥卢斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终有一日，所有人都会向所有人敞开身心。"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽然，地板上的尸体像离水的海鳞般弹动起来，发出近乎凄厉的吸气声，随即又瘫倒在地。\n伊西多注意到尸体的眼皮缓缓抬起，露出陌生生物的眼睛。\n嘴唇开阖，发出似人非人的声音。\n“你也......同我......一样......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我绝不会......绝不会同你一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧哼哧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拱来拱去）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拍打胸鳍）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（狠狠啃咬）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么！痛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小动物在他脚旁扭动，试图用它那圆滚滚的身躯盖住他的脚。\n繁杂的声响从四面八方灌入棚屋。那之中有哭泣，有争论，但更多的是咒骂。\n但愿他们咒骂的不是自己，伊西多停下动作，下意识地想。\n他探出头，看守竟反常地不在门外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g9_community_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"聚落中，一行队伍垂着头走过，每个人身上的衣服都染着污血。\n队伍后面拖行的木板上躺着几个重伤的人，伤口深可见骨，却只用破布草草包扎。\n血液将木板浸透，在雪白的盐层上留下长长的拖痕。\n只有几声间或的喘息证明他们仍然活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沮丧的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少了几乎一半......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沮丧的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1589_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......是遇到什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"审判庭的经棍一早埋伏在必经之路上。许多伙伴都牺牲了，就剩我们......好不容易逃回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲伤的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子里的家伙没有盐船，是怎么深入盐漠找到你们的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没人知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们就像恶灵一样，仿佛感受不到痛苦，即使受伤也不会倒下，立刻又会展开攻击。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）镇子里都是普通的教士，只不过修习过一点武艺......怎么可能做到这种程度？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂奇，你来了，其他的队伍呢？有成功完成目标回来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你们一样，都损失惨重，还有一支队伍至今都没有任何消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这样下去，我们连打捞队的人手都要凑不齐了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蒂奇本想说些什么，但她突然在人群中看到伊西多。\n她走上前去，粗暴地将伊西多拽到鲁斯面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么跑出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看守不在门口......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他跟着一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不同意，这是你们的事，我不想插手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，这里的规矩是想吃饭就要干活，你既然不想炼金，那就来干些别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直接让我离开不行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想都别想，我们可是很缺人的，你就准备一直在这里干活干到死吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别拽我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲁斯，后天早上，带上他在这里集合，夫人那边我去说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糊涂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧哼哧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也想去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疯狂点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（气愤啃鳍）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g13_ibtown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小叶，行李放在这里就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"温蒂小姐，请稍等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白......你为什么带了这么多东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见棘刺那家伙，我作为朋友当然是要给他带些东西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以让小叶帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用不用，这点小重量不在话——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，箱子装太多爆开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，小叶，一起来收拾下这一地的行李吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一大兜......面膜、润肤露......好沉！你怎么会有这么多护肤品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里阳光充足，当然要注意保护皮肤，我可不想重演上次度假的悲剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是来寻找失踪的棘刺干员吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，那么大个小伙子，丢不了的。让我看看，这一袋是什么......哦，衣服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这次任务需要整整一皮箱的衣服吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出门在外代表的可是罗德岛，当然要注意下个人形象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这些东西里哪样是给棘刺的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是那个，你脚下那个！对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"防晒霜......防水、清爽、美白......棘刺需要这个东西吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，太阳这么大，把他晒黑了怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是他朋友，你说需要就需要吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你拽我干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人过来了，我们别挡了路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"执裁官大人！您今晚还会为大家布道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我感谢您！我妻子原来每天半夜都会爬起来，去厨房偷吃我们的存粮，她白天明明都按照教诲从不贪食的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"自从听您布道后，她再也没有这样做过！是您的教诲净化了她，我真感谢您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是向众人分享我所得的一切身外之物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虔诚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这......您太谦卑了，执裁官阁下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感恩的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"执裁官大人，请让我握住您的手，雅隆最近出了这么多事，我太害怕了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这能给您带来安慰的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真挚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我，我从来没干过坏事，我是不是也能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真挚的镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能求您抚摸一下我的头顶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别挤，一个一个来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"习武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制一下时间！提前想好要说的话！别占用执裁官阁下太多时间！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）他们这里怎么感觉有点怪怪的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）可能只是出于对审判庭的信任吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道这里管事的人在哪里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问需要帮忙吗，二位？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那真是太感谢了！老兄，该怎么称呼啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安纳斯塔西奥，我的名字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）这家伙可真受欢迎啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）的确，一路上每个看到他的人都会停下来与他打招呼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"证裁官西尔弗阁下就在此处等候，二位进门就是。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太有魅力也是种烦恼，我懂你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安纳斯塔西奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1582_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位先生他......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我和他只是同事，不是很熟悉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，贵客来访，我们却拿不出什么东西来招待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子里的粮仓被强盗焚毁，在商队下一次到来前，大家都要挨饿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事，我们自己也有带吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实在抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还没正式介绍过自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是外勤部干员极境，我是工程部干员温蒂，同属罗德岛制药公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是工程师？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您对风力驱动的轻型陆行舰有了解吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我专精的是生物工程，对机械工程了解不多。不过，以我有限的认知来讲，这是一项很难完成的设计。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和海上的航船不同，如果材料不够坚韧，陆行舰在动起来的那一刻就会分崩离析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（焦躁地吹起红毛）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果采用钢制的龙骨呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那样造出来的陆行舰恐怕又会太重，很难像您说的那样，用风力驱动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您是说，制造这样的一艘陆行舰几乎是不可能的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我相信有人能做出这样近乎不可能的设计。只要设计的难关解决了，实际的制造不会太难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少对于现在作茧自缚的伊比利亚来说......不会比制造一艘真正的陆行舰更难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（急切地挥动双手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，不好意思！我们是不是应该，呃，先谈正事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我朋友的下落......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉！我失态了。您能描述一下您朋友的特征吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，绝对不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的朋友绝对不可能做出那样的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还请冷静，极境先生，我只是在陈述事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是，我们罗德岛的干员与盐漠中的强盗勾结，盗取本镇镇民的尸体，并且伙同强盗从行刑地点逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他接受审问时并未提及自己的罗德岛干员身份......但他的罪行属实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"极境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，我想这其中肯定是有什么误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，但我们所掌握的信息，都指向这名逃犯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧哼哧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（扭动身躯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，别跟着我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对宝宝说话放尊敬点，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对它与对你们的态度是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就都尊敬点！宝宝可比你有用多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以为它是你们的口粮储备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它可是首领的心头肉，谁敢动它一枚鳞片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"况且，它的感官在盐漠里比我们敏锐得多，靠它我们才能找到盐层下面的好东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，黄金时代的古董，要么是高科技，要么是奢侈品，值钱得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可审判庭不是一向严禁人们挖掘黄金时代的遗迹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们不喜欢，那些偷偷入境的商队可喜欢得不得了。我们拿这些玩意儿换淡水，换物资，总好过要饭吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种非法交易......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别摆出那副表情。在这地方，人能活着就不容易了，哪那么多讲究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你，小子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将来炼金用的那些材料，哪怕只是一截鳞骨，也是一位船员靠着双手，付出许多艰辛得来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好好考虑下吧。要是知道自己不行，就别浪费那些资源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想我怎么做？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炼金的时候随便弄点动静出来，给首领一个失败的讯号，让她知难而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）你直接放我走不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，这些话为什么不和她直说呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想让首领感受到我们对她计划的抵触，我们尊敬她......也惧怕她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惧怕？是，她打架很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不是她真正的可怕之处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g1_saltdesert_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是从风中捕捉到了一丝不寻常的声音，胡安娜停下脚步。\n她回过头，空旷的盐漠中除了她留下的足迹，看不到任何生物活动的痕迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"松了一口气，她继续前行。前方，巨大的骸骨下是一片浓重的阴影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜走入阴影，消失不见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g3_newdeck_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年，船队里曾发生过一起叛乱，但太过久远，只有一些老家伙还记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人当众指控胡安娜与海里的怪物达成交易，她将所有船员献祭给怪物，来换取强大的武力与长寿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是指海嗣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随你们怎么叫。这里的海水刚退去的时候，那些怪物还猖獗得很，是科鲁兹船长带人拼死把它们清除殆尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而科鲁兹船长......他们都死在了盐漠中，只有胡安娜回来了，只有她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一回来就接管了船队的一切，那些不愿服从她的人，也在狩猎活动与审判庭的围剿中一个个死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也说了，那只是传言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......事情发生的时候，就连蒂奇也还只是个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得胡安娜女士修复罗盘的目的并非帮助大家寻找出路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许......那只是她伟大计划下的一个小小目标，至于她要达成的最终目标是什么，谁也不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样想的人，除了你还有别人吗，鲁斯先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有那么一些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈维尔先生也在其中吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那孩子他从不会怀疑首领。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年，哈维尔一直将首领视为自己的母亲。他母亲死后，正是首领抚养他长大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些传闻中的海嗣......有船员见过它们吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没......从没有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哧......哼哧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宝宝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1586_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吭——吭——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_293_thorns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，看来宝宝发现了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懒家伙们，降帆！抛锚！我们要下船了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞斯克","speakerId":"avg_npc_1591_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传令！准备开挖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鲁斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1590_1","isRemote":false,"text":"记得带好你的工具与武器，小子，别想乱跑，我会派人盯紧你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
